      "content": "it's not just about being sad tho. i just look at them and see how much harder i'm making their lives by even being here. if i wasn't around, they wouldn't have to worry about me being stressed or us struggling for money. it feels like the only way to actually help them is to just... not be a part of their struggle anymore.",
